  "bodyHtml": "\n                            <p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">사실&nbsp;오늘은&nbsp;한&nbsp;일은&nbsp;별로&nbsp;없었어요...</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">오늘은&nbsp;코딩이&nbsp;잘&nbsp;되던&nbsp;날은&nbsp;아니었거든요...&nbsp;될&nbsp;듯한것도&nbsp;계속&nbsp;안&nbsp;되서,&nbsp;되게&nbsp;할려고&nbsp;몇&nbsp;시간동안&nbsp;만져서</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">겨우&nbsp;되긴&nbsp;했는데,&nbsp;거기에&nbsp;시간을&nbsp;너무&nbsp;많이&nbsp;소비해서...</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">오늘은&nbsp;데이터가&nbsp;많은&nbsp;경우를&nbsp;대비해서&nbsp;여러&nbsp;데이터&nbsp;중에서&nbsp;사용자가&nbsp;원하는&nbsp;데이터만&nbsp;뽑을&nbsp;수&nbsp;있도록</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">select로&nbsp;자료를&nbsp;출력할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있도록&nbsp;하였습니다.</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">그리고&nbsp;오늘,&nbsp;다행히&nbsp;파싱&nbsp;작업이&nbsp;조금&nbsp;순조롭게&nbsp;되어서&nbsp;원하는&nbsp;데이터만&nbsp;추출하는&nbsp;건&nbsp;완료하였습니다.</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">그리고,&nbsp;하다보니까&nbsp;새로운&nbsp;점도&nbsp;알게&nbsp;되었습니다.&nbsp;html.erb에서&nbsp;each&nbsp;do&nbsp;|x|만&nbsp;써왔는데,&nbsp;제가&nbsp;순서순으로&nbsp;id값을&nbsp;만들려면&nbsp;어떻게&nbsp;해야될&nbsp;지</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">몰랐었는데,&nbsp;찾아보니까&nbsp;</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">.each_with_index&nbsp;do&nbsp;|x,&nbsp;i|</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">이걸로&nbsp;id는&nbsp;i,&nbsp;함수등은&nbsp;x로&nbsp;될&nbsp;수&nbsp;있었습니다.&nbsp;그&nbsp;결과</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">&lt;select&nbsp;name=\"job\"&gt;</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;option&nbsp;value=&gt;선택하세요&lt;/option&gt;</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">&lt;%&nbsp;@test.each_with_index&nbsp;do&nbsp;|x,&nbsp;i|%&gt;</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;option&nbsp;value=&lt;%=&nbsp;x.xpath(\"//span[@class='l1']//a\")[i][\"href\"]&nbsp;%&gt;&gt;</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;%=x.content&nbsp;%&gt;</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/option&gt;</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;%&nbsp;end&nbsp;%&gt;</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">&lt;/select&gt;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">이렇게&nbsp;해서&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; float: none;\"></p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\" filename=\"0fc1f2add18b7fc717fb46ea8f656ce8ce82f36b.png\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\">\n    <span data-lightbox=\"lightbox\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/posts/3/img-001.png\" width=\"1000\" height=\"545\" filename=\"0fc1f2add18b7fc717fb46ea8f656ce8ce82f36b.png\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\">\n    </span>\n    <figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">다음과&nbsp;같은&nbsp;결과를&nbsp;출력할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있었고,&nbsp;value&nbsp;값에&nbsp;해당&nbsp;애니메이션&nbsp;사이트&nbsp;주소를&nbsp;넣을&nbsp;수&nbsp;있었습니다.</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">이렇게&nbsp;하면,&nbsp;다음에&nbsp;더&nbsp;자세한&nbsp;애니메이션&nbsp;정보를&nbsp;가져올&nbsp;때,&nbsp;해당&nbsp;value값에&nbsp;해당되는&nbsp;주소를&nbsp;파싱해서&nbsp;원하는&nbsp;정보를&nbsp;가져오기가&nbsp;수월할&nbsp;것&nbsp;같습니다.</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">그런데,&nbsp;오늘은&nbsp;front-end쪽을&nbsp;만지지&nbsp;않아서,&nbsp;일단&nbsp;지금은&nbsp;select로&nbsp;했지만,&nbsp;디자인을&nbsp;고려해서&nbsp;나중에&nbsp;list로&nbsp;바꿀&nbsp;예정입니다.</span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21.6px;\">내일은,&nbsp;선택&nbsp;부분의&nbsp;front-end를&nbsp;좀&nbsp;만지고,&nbsp;선택한&nbsp;정보를&nbsp;바탕으로&nbsp;데이터를&nbsp;추출해서,&nbsp;이&nbsp;데이터를&nbsp;Database에&nbsp;넣는&nbsp;작업을&nbsp;할&nbsp;예정입니다.</span></p>\n                        ",
